## Native build outputs
#
# The ANGLE binaries ARE committed (runtimes/<rid>/native) because the NuGet package is assembled
# from the working tree. The rules below only exclude build scratch space, never the binaries
# themselves; keep the negations if you add broader patterns.
native/**/bin/
native/**/obj/

